---
// Experience.astro
---

<section id="experience" class="py-16 md:py-24 relative border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header Minimalist -->
    <div class="space-y-2 mb-12 reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold tracking-wider">
        02 // <span class="lang-id">PENGALAMAN KERJA & RISET</span><span class="lang-en hidden">WORK & RESEARCH EXPERIENCE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        <span class="lang-id">Riwayat Pengalaman Profesional</span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">Professional Work History</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        <span class="lang-id">Pengalaman kerja industri manufaktur, riset sains material, dan kepemimpinan laboratorium.</span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">Industrial manufacturing experience, materials science research, and laboratory instruction.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 1. FEATURED CAREER CARD: PT. SHOU FONG LASTINDO -->
    <div class="mb-10 reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="card-minimal p-6 sm:p-8 border-slate-300/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Subtle top accent line -->
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 via-cyan-500 to-blue-500"></div>

        <!-- Card Header: Role & Period -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-6 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80">
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wide">
                <span class="lang-id">PEKERJAAN AKTIF SAAT INI</span>
                <span class="lang-en hidden">CURRENT POSITION</span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-slate-300 dark:text-slate-700">•</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                Full-time
              </span>
            </div>
            
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
              Mekanik (Departemen Mekanik)
            </h3>
            
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
              PT. Shou Fong Lastindo <span class="text-slate-400">• Pabrik Sepatu / Industri Alas Kaki</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Clean Period Badge -->
          <div class="sm:text-right shrink-0">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-500/20 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping"></span>
              <span class="font-bold">10 Okt 2026 – Sekarang</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono mt-1">
              <span class="lang-id">Sedang Berlangsung</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Present / Active</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Description Summary -->
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed py-5">
          <span class="lang-id">
            Bertanggung jawab penuh atas keandalan mekanis, efisiensi operasional, dan pemeliharaan mesin-mesin pada lini perakitan sepatu (*assembly line*) di pabrik manufaktur alas kaki PT. Shou Fong Lastindo.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">
            Responsible for maintaining mechanical reliability, maximizing operational efficiency, and servicing production equipment across footwear assembly lines at PT. Shou Fong Lastindo.
          </span>
        </p>

        <!-- 3-Pillar Jobdesk Breakdown -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
          
          <!-- Pillar 1 -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-500">01.</span>
              <span class="lang-id">Preventive Maintenance</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Preventive Care</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              <span class="lang-id">
                Pemeliharaan terjadwal harian dan mingguan pada mesin lini produksi sepatu: mesin potong *cutting press*, mesin jahit industri, *toe lasting*, *heel lasting*, *cementing*, dan oven conveyor *curing*.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">
                Scheduled daily and weekly servicing on critical footwear equipment: hydraulic cutting presses, sewing machines, toe/heel lasting units, and conveyor ovens.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Pillar 2 -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-cyan-500">02.</span>
              <span class="lang-id">Troubleshooting Cepat</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Rapid Repairs</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              <span class="lang-id">
                Penanganan darurat kendala mekanikal mendadak (*breakdown maintenance*) pada sistem transmisi sabuk, puli, rantai, gearbox, dan aktuator silinder pneumatik untuk meminimalkan *downtime*.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">
                Urgent troubleshooting on transmission belts, pulleys, chains, gearboxes, and pneumatic cylinder actuators to minimize factory downtime.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Pillar 3 -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#0b0f19] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 space-y-2">
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="text-blue-500">03.</span>
              <span class="lang-id">Kalibrasi & K3 Industri</span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">Calibration & HSE</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              <span class="lang-id">
                Kalibrasi tekanan angin pneumatik (*line pressure*), temperatur pemanas aktivasi lem, penggantian suku cadang aus (bearing, seal, pisau), serta pengisian logbook harian perawatan.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en hidden">
                Calibrating pneumatic line pressures and heater temperatures, replacing worn bearings/blades, and keeping precise maintenance logbooks.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Tech Chips -->
        <div class="pt-5 mt-5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/80 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-md">Mesin Alas Kaki</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-md">Sistem Pneumatik</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-md">Transmisi Sabuk & Puli</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-md">Preventive Maintenance</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-md">Standar K3 Pabrik</span>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. OTHER EXPERIENCES (ACADEMIC, RESEARCH, ORGANIZATIONAL) -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span class="lang-id">// Pengalaman Riset, Asisten Lab & Delegasi</span>
        <span class="lang-en hidden">// Research, Lab Assistance & Delegation</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience Item 2: MBKM Riset Material -->
      <div class="card-minimal p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700 reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold uppercase">RISET SAINS MATERIAL</span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-0.5">
              MBKM Riset & Karakterisasi Material Komposit
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Universitas Trunodjoyo Madura • Kemendikbudristek
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Agu – Des 2025
            </span>
            <button 
              data-lightbox 
              data-img="/images/riset_komposit_hand_layup.png" 
              data-title="Dokumentasi Fabrikasi Komposit Hand Lay-Up Standar ASTM" 
              data-desc="Proses preparasi pemotongan serat fiber mat, penimbangan rasio fraksi volume, dan pencetakan spesimen komposit."
              class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-500 transition"
            >
              Foto Lab →
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 pt-3 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-id">
            Riset formulasi komposit sandwich serat alam sebagai alternatif material genting ringan. Menghitung fraksi volume serat dan matriks, membuat spesimen metode hand lay-up berstandar ASTM, melaksanakan pengujian mekanik & termal, serta mengolah data kurva tegangan-regangan di OriginLab.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">
            Research on natural fiber sandwich composites for lightweight roof panel applications. Hand lay-up specimen preparation, ASTM standard tensile/thermal testing, and stress-strain curve plotting in OriginLab.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience Item 3: Asisten Praktikum Manufaktur -->
      <div class="card-minimal p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700 reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold uppercase">ASISTEN LABORATORIUM</span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-0.5">
              Asisten Praktikum Proses Manufaktur
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Fakultas Teknik, Universitas Trunodjoyo Madura
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Mei 2025
            </span>
            <button 
              data-lightbox 
              data-img="/images/asisten_praktikum_mengajar.png" 
              data-title="Dokumentasi Kelas Asisten Praktikum" 
              data-desc="Pemberian materi modul perancangan CAD dan K3 kepada mahasiswa."
              class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-500 transition"
            >
              Foto Kelas →
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 pt-3 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-id">
            Menguji modul praktikum perencanaan permesinan, perancangan 3D Autodesk Inventor, dan assembly pengelasan. Memberikan pembekalan SOP K3 wajib, memandu pelaksanaan praktikum di bengkel mesin, dan mengevaluasi laporan teknis mahasiswa.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">
            Validated machining modules, taught Autodesk Inventor 3D CAD modeling, instructed workshop welding assemblies, and enforced strict HSE procedures.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Experience Item 4: KMI Expo XV 2024 -->
      <div class="card-minimal p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-slate-700 reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800/60">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold uppercase">AJANG INOVASI NASIONAL</span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-0.5">
              Peserta KMI Expo XV 2024 Kendari
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-mono">
              Universitas Halu Oleo • Kemendikbudristek
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Okt 2024
            </span>
            <button 
              data-lightbox 
              data-img="/images/kmi_expo_tim.jpg" 
              data-title="Kontingen Universitas Trunodjoyo Madura di KMI Expo 2024" 
              data-desc="Foto resmi panggung expo di Kendari."
              class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 text-xs font-mono text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-cyan-500 transition"
            >
              Foto Tim →
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 pt-3 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-id">
            Mewakili kampus memamerkan produk inovasi genting komposit polimer ramah lingkungan berbasis daur ulang plastik. Memaparkan prospek komersialisasi dan keunggulan mekanik kepada pelaku usaha dan calon investor industri.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en hidden">
            Represented the university showcasing recycled plastic composite roof tiles. Pitched business viability and technical advantages directly to industry investors and business leaders.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
